    },
    "It's on my mind more" : {
      "comment" : "Feedback text for a user who found postponing a hassle.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's on my mind more"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "かえって気になる"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오히려 더 신경 쓰여요"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "反而更放不下了"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "反而更放不下了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's only the first one. In studies, the effect built up over a few weeks. Park a few more and compare them in your Exit Log." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's only the first one. In studies, the effect built up over a few weeks. Park a few more and compare them in your Exit Log."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "まだ最初の 1 件です。研究では、効果は数週間かけて積み重なっていきました。あと何件か駐車して、出庫ログで比べてみましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이제 첫 번째일 뿐이에요. 연구에서도 효과는 몇 주에 걸쳐 쌓였어요. 몇 번 더 주차해 보고 출차 기록에서 비교해 보세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这只是第一次。研究显示，效果要几周才会慢慢积累。多停放几个，在出场记录里比一比。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這只是第一次。研究顯示，效果要幾週才會慢慢累積。多停放幾個，在出場紀錄裡比一比。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's out of the lot. Drive away." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's out of the car park. Drive away."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "駐車場から出ました。見送りましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주차장을 떠났어요. 이제 보내주세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它已驶出停车场。让它走吧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它已駛出停車場。讓它走吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's parked until tomorrow's Worry Time. When it pops up again in the shower, just tell yourself: it already has a spot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's parked until tomorrow's Worry Time. When it pops up again in the shower, just tell yourself: it already has a spot."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "明日の心配タイムまで駐車中です。お風呂でまた浮かんできたら、「もう場所はあるよ」と伝えるだけで大丈夫です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "내일 걱정 시간까지 주차해 뒀어요. 샤워하다 다시 떠오르면 '이미 자리가 있어'라고만 말해 주세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它会一直停到明天的烦恼时间。洗澡时它再冒出来，就对自己说：它已经有车位了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它會一直停到明天的煩惱時間。洗澡時它再冒出來，就對自己說：它已經有車位了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's Worry Time. Give it %lld focused minutes, then decide what to do with it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's Worry Time. Give it %lld focused minutes, then decide what to do with it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配タイムです。%lld 分だけ集中して向き合い、どうするか決めましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정 시간이에요. %lld분만 집중해서 들여다보고 어떻게 할지 정해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烦恼时间到了。给它 %lld 分钟专注的时间，然后决定怎么处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "煩惱時間到了。給它 %lld 分鐘專注的時間，然後決定怎麼處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
