    "Looking straight at a worry can make it feel bigger at first. You don't have to solve it now. Its only job is to wait for Worry Time." : {
      "comment" : "Feedback response for a user who chose \"heavier\" for the \"How postponing felt\" question.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Looking straight at a worry can make it feel bigger at first. You don't have to solve it now. Its only job is to wait for Worry Time."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配をまっすぐ見つめると、最初は大きく感じることがあります。今すぐ解決しなくて大丈夫。心配の仕事は、心配タイムまで待つことだけです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정을 똑바로 들여다보면 처음엔 더 크게 느껴질 수 있어요. 지금 해결하지 않아도 돼요. 이 걱정이 할 일은 걱정 시간까지 기다리는 것뿐이에요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直视烦恼，一开始可能会觉得它变大了。现在不必解决它，它唯一的任务就是等到烦恼时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直視煩惱，一開始可能會覺得它變大了。現在不必解決它，它唯一的任務就是等到煩惱時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
