    "Making a concrete plan stopped unfinished tasks from intruding on people's thoughts, and five minutes of writing before bed helped people fall asleep faster." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Making a concrete plan stopped unfinished tasks from intruding on people's thoughts, and five minutes of writing before bed helped people fall asleep faster."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "具体的な計画を立てると、やり残したことが頭に入り込みにくくなり、寝る前に 5 分書き出した人は早く眠りにつけました。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "구체적인 계획을 세우면 끝나지 않은 일이 생각에 덜 끼어들었고, 자기 전 5분 동안 할 일을 적은 사람들은 더 빨리 잠들었어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "制定具体计划后，没做完的事就不再闯进思绪；睡前写五分钟，还能让人更快入睡。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "擬定具體計畫後，沒做完的事就不再闖進思緒；睡前寫五分鐘，還能讓人更快入睡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
