    "People who moved their worrying to a short daily worry period spent less time worrying and reported less anxiety and fewer sleep problems." : {
      "comment" : "Research study showing that people who moved their worrying to a short daily worry period spent less time worrying and reported less anxiety and fewer sleep problems.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "People who moved their worrying to a short daily worry period spent less time worrying and reported less anxiety and fewer sleep problems."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配する時間を毎日の短い時間に移した人は、心配に費やす時間が減り、不安や睡眠の問題も軽くなったと報告しています。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정을 매일 짧은 걱정 시간으로 옮긴 사람들은 걱정하는 시간이 줄고, 불안과 수면 문제도 덜 겪었다고 보고했어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把烦恼挪到每天固定的一小段时间里，人们花在烦恼上的时间更少，焦虑和睡眠问题也有所减轻。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把煩惱挪到每天固定的一小段時間裡，人們花在煩惱上的時間更少，焦慮和睡眠問題也有所減輕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick your Worry Time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick your Worry Time"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配タイムを選ぼう"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정 시간을 정해요"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择你的烦恼时间"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇你的煩惱時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Postponing is working for you. Try parking the next one too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Postponing is working for you. Try parking the next one too."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先延ばしが効いています。次の心配もここに駐車してみましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정 미루기가 효과를 내고 있어요. 다음 걱정도 여기에 주차해 보세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "推迟起效了。下一个烦恼也试着停在这里吧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "延後奏效了。下一個煩惱也試著停在這裡吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Postponing works best when you wait. Most worries feel smaller by Worry Time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Postponing works best when you wait. Most worries feel smaller by Worry Time."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先延ばしは、待つほどよく効きます。たいていの心配は、心配タイムには小さく感じられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "미루기는 기다릴 때 가장 효과가 좋아요. 대부분의 걱정은 걱정 시간이 되면 작아져 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待时推迟的效果最好。大多数烦恼到了烦恼时间都会变小。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待時延後的效果最好。大多數煩惱到了煩惱時間都會變小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
