    "What do you want to do with it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What do you want to do with it?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この心配をどうしますか？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 걱정을 어떻게 할까요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你想怎么处理它？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你想怎麼處理它？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What if I blank during tomorrow's presentation and everyone decides I'm not good enough?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What if I blank during tomorrow's presentation and everyone decides I'm not good enough?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "明日の発表で頭が真っ白になって、みんなに力不足だと思われたらどうしよう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "내일 발표 때 머리가 하얘져서 다들 내가 무능하다고 생각하면 어떡하지?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果我明天演讲时脑子一片空白，大家都觉得我不够好怎么办？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果我明天簡報時腦袋一片空白，大家都覺得我不夠好怎麼辦？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you feared didn't happen. Each exit like this goes into your Exit Log, so you can see how often your worries turn out wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you feared didn't happen. Each exit like this goes into your Exit Log, so you can see how often your worries turn out wrong."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配していたことは起きませんでした。こうした出庫は出庫ログに残るので、心配がどれくらい外れるか見えてきます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정한 일이 일어나지 않았어요. 이런 출차가 출차 기록에 쌓이면, 내 걱정이 얼마나 자주 빗나가는지 눈으로 볼 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你担心的事没有发生。像这样的出场都会记入出场记录，让你看到自己的烦恼有多少是白担心。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你擔心的事沒有發生。像這樣的出場都會記進出場紀錄，讓你看到自己的煩惱有多少是白擔心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's circling in your head?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What's circling in your head?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "頭の中で何がぐるぐるしていますか？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "머릿속에 맴도는 게 뭔가요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你脑子里在转什么？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你腦袋裡在轉什麼？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When people with chronic worry tracked their worries, %lld%% of them didn't come true." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When people with chronic worry tracked their worries, %lld%% of them didn't come true."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "慢性的に心配しやすい人が自分の心配を記録したところ、%lld%% は実際には起こりませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "만성적으로 걱정하는 사람들이 자기 걱정을 기록해 보니, %lld%%는 실제로 일어나지 않았어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期爱担忧的人记录自己的烦恼后发现，有 %lld%% 并没有成真。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長期容易擔憂的人記錄自己的煩惱後發現，有 %lld%% 並沒有成真。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When should it come back?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When should it come back?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "いつ戻しますか？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "언제 다시 꺼낼까요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "什么时候取回来？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "什麼時候取回來？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While it was parked, how did this worry feel?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While it was parked, how did this worry feel?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "駐車していた間、この心配はどう感じましたか？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주차해 둔 동안, 이 걱정은 어땠어요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停放期间，这个烦恼感觉怎么样？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停放期間，這個煩惱感覺怎麼樣？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why it works" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Why it works"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "なぜ効くの？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "왜 효과가 있을까요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为什么有效"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為什麼有效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without them, parked worries wait silently in the lot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without them, parked worries wait silently in the lot."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通知がないと、駐車した心配は駐車場で静かに待つだけになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "알림이 없으면 주차된 걱정이 주차장에서 조용히 기다리기만 해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有提醒的话，停放的烦恼只会在停车场里静静等着。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒有提醒的話，停放的煩惱只會在停車場裡靜靜等著。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worries don't have to ride with you all night.\nPark them here. We'll keep them until your Worry Time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Worries don't have to ride with you all night.\nPark them here. We'll keep them until your Worry Time."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配を一晩中連れ回さなくていいんです。\nここに駐車してください。心配タイムまで預かります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정을 밤새 태우고 다닐 필요는 없어요.\n여기에 주차해 두세요. 걱정 시간까지 맡아둘게요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烦恼不必陪你熬一整夜。\n把它们停在这里，我们替你保管到烦恼时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "煩惱不必陪你熬一整夜。\n把它們停在這裡，我們替你保管到煩惱時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worries show up anywhere: in bed, in the shower, on the way home. When worrying gets its own time, your brain learns that the rest of the day isn't for it. Psychologists call this stimulus control." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of the mechanism of worry postponement, based on cognitive behavioral therapy.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Worries show up anywhere: in bed, in the shower, on the way home. When worrying gets its own time, your brain learns that the rest of the day isn't for it. Psychologists call this stimulus control."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配はどこにでも現れます。ベッドの中、お風呂、帰り道。心配に専用の時間を与えると、脳は一日の残りの時間はその出番ではないと学びます。心理学ではこれを刺激統制と呼びます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정은 침대에서, 샤워하다가, 퇴근길에 어디서든 튀어나와요. 걱정에 따로 시간을 정해 주면, 뇌는 나머지 시간은 걱정할 때가 아니라는 걸 배워요. 심리학에서는 이를 ‘자극 통제’라고 불러요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烦恼无处不在：躺在床上、洗澡时、下班路上。给烦恼划出专属时间后，大脑就会明白一天里其余的时间不是留给它的。心理学家把这叫作刺激控制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "煩惱無處不在：躺在床上、洗澡時、下班路上。給煩惱劃出專屬時間後，大腦就會明白一天裡其餘的時間不是留給它的。心理學家把這叫做刺激控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worries you review at the exit gate land here. Over time you'll see how many of them actually happened." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Worries you review at the exit gate land here. Over time you'll see how many of them actually happened."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出庫ゲートで振り返った心配はここに積み重なります。続けるうちに、実際に起きたものがどれくらいあるかが見えてきます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "출차 게이트에서 돌아본 걱정이 여기에 쌓여요. 시간이 지나면 실제로 일어난 게 얼마나 되는지 보여요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在出场闸口回顾过的烦恼会汇集在这里。时间久了，你会看到其中有多少真的发生了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在出場閘口回顧過的煩惱會匯集在這裡。時間久了，你會看到其中有多少真的發生了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
