    "Write down one worry that's on your mind right now. It will really be parked and come back %@." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the onboarding step where the user writes down a worry.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write down one worry that's on your mind right now. It will really be parked and come back %@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今、頭にある心配をひとつ書いてみましょう。実際に駐車されて、%@に戻ってきます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "지금 머릿속에 있는 걱정 하나를 적어 보세요. 실제로 주차되고, %@에 다시 돌아와요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写下此刻脑子里的一个烦恼。它会真的被停放，并在%@回来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寫下此刻腦袋裡的一個煩惱。它會真的被停放，並在%@回來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write it down to put it down" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write it down to put it down"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "書き出して、手放す"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "적어서 내려놓기"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写下来，才能放下"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寫下來，才能放下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write it exactly the way it sounds in your head." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write it exactly the way it sounds in your head."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "頭の中で聞こえるとおりに書いてみましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "머릿속에서 들리는 그대로 적어 보세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "照着脑中的声音原样写下来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "照著腦中的聲音原樣寫下來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't need to carry this right now. We'll bring it back %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You don't need to carry this right now. We'll bring it back %@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今は抱えていなくて大丈夫です。%@にお届けします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "지금은 이걸 짊어지지 않아도 돼요. %@에 다시 가져다 드릴게요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你现在不用背着它。我们会在%@把它送回来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你現在不用揹著它。我們會在%@把它送回來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You postponed a worry and came back to it on purpose. That's the whole technique." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You postponed a worry and came back to it on purpose. That's the whole technique."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配を先延ばしにして、決めた時間にあえて向き合いました。これがこの方法のすべてです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정을 미뤄 두었다가 정해 둔 때에 다시 마주했어요. 이게 이 기법의 전부예요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你把烦恼推迟了，又特意回头面对它。这就是这个方法的全部。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你把煩惱延後，又特意回頭面對它。這就是這個方法的全部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your answers stay on this iPhone. You can look back at them in your Exit Log." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the user's feedback is stored.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your answers stay on this iPhone. You can look back at them in your Exit Log."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回答はこの iPhone にだけ保存されます。出庫ログであとから見返せます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "답변은 이 iPhone에만 저장돼요. 출차 기록에서 다시 볼 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的回答只保存在这部 iPhone 上。可以在出场记录里回看。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的回答只儲存在這支 iPhone 上。可以在出場紀錄裡回顧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your daily Worry Time is %@. You can change it in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
